platform-security-patrol (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 新增deb打包功能，移除platform-secrity-patrol.spec文件
  * 新增make uninstall卸载支持
  * 分离插件安装规则到各插件目录的CMakeLists.txt中，同步单元测试
  * 修复插件在plugins/、plugins/environment/、plugins/capability/下重复安装的问题
  * 新增编译宏-D_GNU_SOURCE，避免strcasestr编译报错
  * 重命名error_t为psp_error_t，避免与usr/include/aarch64-linux-gnu/bits/types/error_t.h文件中error_t类型冲突

 -- Platform Security Team <suchangzheng@kylinos.cn>  Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800

platform-security-patrol (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Support for Hygon CPU security capabilities detection (C86-3G/C86-4G)
  * Plugin-based architecture for extensibility
  * Three-layer judgment mechanism (CPU/Firmware/OS)
  * CSV1/CSV2/CSV3, TPM 2.0, TCM 2.0, TKM, TDM capability definitions

 -- Platform Security Team <security@openkylin.org.cn>  Tue, 07 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0800
